{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":59,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"06fabaee-c764-4f85-a103-7d3d9bae8a05","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310276448,"PostDateInt":1793081103000,"PostDate":"2026-10-27T14:05:03","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"安全工程师(J21066)","OrgId":3649331,"Org":"生产运营中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["内蒙古自治区·兴安盟"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1）配合安环部实施生产准备-HSE准备工作。2）组织编制生产部安全管理制度、培训教材、培训方案、实施安全培训。3）组织编制生产部现场应急处置方案。4）组织实施生产部安全演练。5）组织实施全厂安全隐患排查治理。6）组织生产部安全例会。7）组织生产部应急物资、工具、劳动防护用品统计、申报、存储、使用。8）与安环部对接日常HSE管理工作。9）车间劳动纪律、操作纪律监管。","Require":"1）化工装置安全管理工作经验5年。2）熟悉企业安全管理相关法规政策。3）良好的沟通表达能力、文字编辑能力、学习能力、计划能力、执行能力、总结能力。4）具有团队协作意识、品行端正。5）安环类/化工类/机械类/电气类/仪控类专业毕业。","ClassificationOne":"金风绿能化工","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-27T14:05:03","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"66b6fbbe-2370-455a-b27f-06f2cddadc52","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310276413,"PostDateInt":1792997638000,"PostDate":"2026-10-26T14:53:58","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级岩土工程师(J23368)","OrgId":700409117,"Org":"工程技术部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市·朝阳区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、方案论证：参与重大岩土工程专项方案评审、专家论证，对复杂地基、软土地基等重难点工程提出业主方技术意见，为项目质量管控提供技术支撑。\n2、技术把控：作为业主单位岩土专业技术负责人，统筹项目岩土工程全流程管理，对接地勘、设计、施工、监理等单位，协调解决地基处理、软基加固等关键技术问题，把控技术标准与实施质量。\n3、技术审核：负责对地质勘察单位提交的勘察报告、成果资料进行全面审核，核查结论合理性，提出专业审核意见。\n4、设计管理：牵头审核设计单位编制的岩土工程专项方案、地基处理设计文件，重点针对各类地基处理、软土地基处理方案进行技术论证、经济比选，确保方案安全、经济、高效。","Require":"1、全日制岩土工程专业博士研究生学历优先；持有一级注册岩土工程师执业资格证书。\n2、具备深厚的岩土工程理论功底，在各类地基处理、复合地基、软土地基处理领域拥有丰富工程经验。\n3、拥有海上工程经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":"天润新能","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-26T14:53:58","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"f0b0eac6-056f-4b53-bb99-0b8c8fe073a2","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310276387,"PostDateInt":1792573017000,"PostDate":"2026-10-21T16:56:57","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"并网工程师(J24433)","OrgId":3230586,"Org":"工程服务技术职能","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 并网技术方案与仿真：负责电网模型构建、机组涉网参数审核，编制并网测试方案，解决并网技术难题​\n2. 现场测试与问题排查：主导、参与现场并网测试，完成数据记录与初步分析，协助问题整改及电网验收​\n3. 技术协调与文档管理：跨区域 / 跨部门技术沟通，协调内外部资源支持测试执行，负责技术文档、报告及案例归档​\n4. 标准应用与数据库维护：分析国际电网新规，制定适配方案，维护集团并网技术数据库与测试案例库​\n5. 新技术跟踪与研发：跟踪惯量响应、宽频振荡抑制等新技术，参与可行性研究与内部技术研讨​","Require":"1. 硕士及以上学历，电力系统、电气工程等相关专业​\n2. 5 年以上电力系统工作经验，其中 3 年 + 风电并网相关经验​\n3. 英语流利，可独立开展技术谈判与文档撰写​​\n4. 熟练使用电网仿真工具​、精通并网标准​、具备场控系统调试及故障诊断经验​\n5. 了解多国电网规范优先​","ClassificationOne":"金风国际","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-21T16:56:57","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"a774497e-0251-442d-aa6c-44bb6b30c078","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310276375,"PostDateInt":1792401626000,"PostDate":"2026-10-19T17:20:26","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"商务主管/经理(J24427)","OrgId":3118368,"Org":"综合部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["内蒙古自治区·兴安盟"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"（一）合同起草与签订管理\n初版合同汇编：招采完成后，整合投标响应文件、澄清文件、挂网合同文本及技术协议，结合内外部评审意见，汇编修改形成初版合同并呈递供应商；对合同整体质量和法律、商务风险进行严格把关。\n合同谈判推进：制定合同谈判策略，跟进单个合同签订过程中供应商及甲方的意见收集与汇总，对双方反馈进行初步筛选与整合，推动消除分歧点；对重点分歧组织内部评审，依据内部要求条款与供应商沟通达成我方意见，汇总完成终版合同，并对合同整体质量与风险承担把关责任。\n（二）商务体系建设\n制度与标准搭建：搭建商务体系，明确招采与商务的分工界面、商务标准工作动作、采购及供应商标准传递资料、合同服务确认等标准要求。\n流程合规管理：熟悉印章使用规范等流程体系，确保商务流程合规，降低操作风险。\n（三）供应商协同对接\n供应商联络管理：作为供应商对接人，负责供应商内外部联络，包括信息资料收取、文件传递及问题协调处理。\n采购执行支持：负责原材料物资采购，协助供应商完成装箱、入库等环节，保障物资交付顺畅有序。\n（四）结算与数字化流程执行\n付款结算管理：熟悉 SCC/OA 流程，审核付款资料，录入服务确认及发票信息，发起付款申请流程，确保结算及时、准确、合规。","Require":"1、统招本科及以上学历，法律、工程、经贸类、市场营销类等相关专业。\n2、具有大型企业原材料 / 物资采购合同、工程管理合同、供应链合同的撰写及评审经验，具备合同执行过程风险识别与分歧处理经验，熟悉原材料采购、结算及供应商管理的全流程。\n3、具备化工工程项目管理现场经验，或大宗原材料采购、供应链管理实战经验者优先；\n4、熟悉国家住建、化工等相关部委关于工程建设、物资采购的政策法规及行业标准；对国家标准合同模板、大型项目合同模板有深入研究，知悉其差异及优化要点，能够结合原材料采购实际场景对合同条款进行针对性优化。\n5、具备良好的沟通表达能力、谈判能力、文字编辑能力、风险识别能力及团队协作能力；熟练应用 WORD、EXCEL、PPT 等办公软件；熟悉 OA、SAP、SCC、CES 等系统操作，能够独立完成付款申请流程及发票流程等相关工作。\n6、良好的团队协作精神，能够与跨部门团队高效合作，保持内外部联系畅通，随时处理和解决相关商务问题。","ClassificationOne":"金风绿能化工","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-19T17:20:26","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"adf5c9d9-0131-46f6-b511-8c75f57774c3","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310276333,"PostDateInt":1791892335000,"PostDate":"2026-10-13T19:52:15","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"服务解决方案主管/经理(J24411)","OrgId":3667676,"Org":"服务解决方案&运营职能","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 岗位概述\n负责风电后服务市场（陆上及海上风电运维）解决方案的规划、开发与交付支持，统筹售前技术支持、合同商务管理、销售订单预测及履约标准化建设，协同销售团队完成服务产品销售目标，最大化支撑区域业务拓展与客户定制化需求。\n2. 岗位职责\nA．售前解决方案支持工作：\n1.\t负责服务业务售前阶段的客户尽调工作，深入了解客户业务状况、运维需求及痛点，为解决方案设计提供精准输入。\n2.\t基于行业发展趋势和客户需求变化，持续创新服务模式，推动服务产品的市场化与标准化。\n3.\t参与服务合同的审阅与谈判工作，从技术及商务维度评估合同条款的可行性与风险，确保公司利益最大化。\n4.\t从总部层面为区域业务团队提供复杂通用问题的技术支持与专业指导，协助区域高效推进项目落地。\n5.\t协同销售团队进行客户技术交流与方案推介，引导客户需求，推动商机转化。\nB．合同执行阶段\n1. 负责和区域各现场对接服务合同拆解，服务后评估等流程执行，并提出优化改进建议。\n2. 负责服务合同的账户维护与管理，确保合同信息的准确性与完整性。\n3. 负责服务合同续签的跟踪准备工作并根据风险和客户诉求更新服务方案，推动存量合同的续签与价值延伸。\nC． 履约标准化\n1.\t基于年度投标趋势，运维数据与项目执行意见，优化服务合同谈判标准。\n2.\t跟踪项目履约情况，将履约阶段风险纳入成本和合同基线，为后续项目风险规避提供数据支撑。\nD. 能力素质\n1.\t具备合同商务意识，熟悉服务合同评审、谈判与管理流程。\n2.\t具备较强的沟通协调能力与跨部门协作能力，能有效整合内外部资源。\n3.\t具备较强的客户痛点洞察能力，能针对客户需求提供定制化解决方案。\n4.\t具备较强的逻辑分析能力与问题解决能力。\n5.\t具备独立完成需求分析、解决方案设计、方案编制和方案推广的能力。\nE. 领导交代的其他工作任务。","Require":"1.\t本科学历以上，商务、语言类、新能源专业优先。\n2.\t3年以上售前商务、服务解决方案工作经验。\n3.\t具有风电后市场解决方案/合同谈判经验者优先。\n4.\t有海上风电项目经验者优先。\n5.\t英语听说读写能力优秀，可作为办公语言，可接受海外出差。","ClassificationOne":"金风国际","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-13T19:52:15","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"6ac9c1ba-9c8a-4950-a83e-e647bcb36085","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310276331,"PostDateInt":1791887047000,"PostDate":"2026-10-13T18:24:07","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"建模仿真工程师(J22783)","OrgId":700181725,"Org":"新能源电力系统研究所","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["新疆维吾尔自治区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、熟练掌握电力系统建模与仿真分析，重点领域有新能源场站高压交、直流输电系统、柔直输电系统宽频震荡稳定性分析与抑制技术、源网耦合稳定性论证等\n2、新能源场站及送出系统总体方案设计及相关专题研究；\n3、科技项目策划、申报和管理；\n4、编写科技项目调研报告、研究报告等；\n5、大客户及生态圈技术交流；\n6、参与国标、行标、企标编审。","Require":"1、硕士研究生及以上学历，电力系统及其自动化专业，同时具有人工智能专业背景和外语水平较好者优先 。\n2、熟练掌握至少一种电力系统分析软件（MATLAB\\PSCAD\\PSSE等），熟悉至少一种高级语言（PyTorch，C\\C++等）\n3、具备良好的学习能力，能够跟进领域内最新技术研究成果，并结合应用场景快速实验和调优\n4、优秀的逻辑思维能力，积极主动，责任心强，有优秀分析和解决问题能力，良好的团队合作和沟通能力","ClassificationOne":"集团直属单位","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-13T18:24:07","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"3b40fc81-847d-44fb-aa71-ab591ddf68c8","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310276051,"PostDateInt":1789612185000,"PostDate":"2026-09-17T10:29:45","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级/主任工艺规划工程师(J24277)","OrgId":100200,"Org":"研发中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、行业技术研判与规划：全面掌握风电行业整体工艺技术发展现状、前沿趋势及技术痛点，对行业技术水平有系统性认知，具备敏锐的技术洞察力，牵头制定公司中长期工艺技术发展战略、整体工艺规划方案及实施路线图，确保工艺技术规划贴合行业发展及公司业务需求。\n2、系统性工艺体系建设：牵头搭建、优化公司风电全流程工艺体系（涵盖研发、生产、安装、运维等各环节），牵头或协同制定统一的工艺标准、技术规范及流程制度，推动工艺技术的标准化、规范化、系统化落地，提升整体工艺效率与质量。\n3、资源协同与技术落地：具备较强的组织协同能力，牵动公司内外资源统筹推进工艺规划项目的落地实施，协调解决规划过程中的跨部门、跨单位技术协同问题。\n4、技术攻关与创新推动：针对风电工艺领域的核心技术瓶颈、行业共性问题，牵头组织技术攻关、新工艺研发及技术优化项目，推动新技术、新工艺、新设备在公司工艺体系中的应用，提升公司工艺技术核心竞争力。\n5、流程建设与项目管理：具备丰富的系统性流程建设经验，牵头梳理、优化工艺相关业务流程，建立流程管控机制，确保流程高效运转；负责工艺规划相关项目的全生命周期管理，包括项目立项、计划制定、进度管控、风险防控、成果验收等，确保项目按时按质完成。\"","Require":"1、学历要求：本科及以上，机械工程、电气工程、电气自动化、工程力学、风电工程等相关专业；\n2、工作年限：5-8 年风电相关工作经验；有2左右现场故障问题处理优先；\n3、行业与专业背景要求：必须具备风电行业工作经验，熟悉陆上 / 海上风电项目建设流程；熟悉并可熟练制定风机吊装、塔筒吊装、机舱吊装、叶轮组装、叶片吊装等关键工序工艺方案与相应工装设备、吊车等设计与选型；了解主流风机机型、塔筒结构、吊装场地、道路及基础条件要求；\n4、核心能力要求：熟练使用CroeCAD、SolidWorks等制图及结构设计软件；具备吊装力学计算、载荷分析，吊车选型等能力；熟悉国家及行业吊装安全规范、起重机械标准、风电施工规范具备独立完成大型吊装方案编制与评审的能力；有吊具、工装、专用设备设计 / 选型 / 改进实际项目经验；具备较强的现场问题处理、技术沟通与方案汇报能力;高级工程师需具备方案审核、团队指导、技术攻关能力。","ClassificationOne":"风电产业集团","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-17T10:29:45","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"c63a3786-411d-48d0-9157-6265e4eb3840","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310275991,"PostDateInt":1789441867000,"PostDate":"2026-09-15T11:11:07","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"化工工艺 / 工程专家(J24259)","OrgId":2968465,"Org":"金风绿能化工","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·无锡市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、工艺设计相关：大型化工项目前期技术方案编制，对接业主开展技术交流、技术协议谈判及签订；负责项目基础工程设计、详细工程设计工作。  2、新工艺开发设计：完成 HMB、PFD、PID 编制，设备工艺计算及选型，编制设备工艺条件表、控制方案及联锁说明、仪表工艺条件表，输出设备布置建议图、装置操作手册等技术文件；聚焦煤化工合成气制备、净化、合成全流程工艺开发。  3、设计承包方管理：对接设计院设计输入、输出条件；明确设计文件内容、深度、质量、进度管控要求；组织设计文件审查，参与 3D 模型审查、HAZOP 分析等专项评审；编制并动态监督项目设计进度计划。  4、参与化工项目可行性研究、投资估算及项目经济性分析，开展工艺方案比选。  5、指导项目施工现场安装管理，负责装置开车调试、运行优化、性能考核等技术工作；对现场操作工开展工艺、操作技术培训与指导。  6、编制设备、材料采购技术规格书，审查供应商技术方案、设计文件，组织技术澄清，把控煤化工核心设备技术准入。  7、独立承担化工工艺专业负责人工作，指导、培养下级工艺工程师，开展专业技能培训；协助部门主管完成化工工程设计、技术管理相关工作。","Require":"任职资格 1、化工工艺、化学工程或相关专业，全日制本科或以上学历；  2、10 年以上设计院 / 工程公司大型煤化工工程设计经验；扎实掌握煤化工单元操作知识，具备向下游配套专业提设计条件能力，熟练掌握国家 / 行业相关标准规范，可独立完成煤化工装置工艺设计；  3、熟练应用 ASPEN Plus 或 HYSIS 或 PRO/II、HTRI 等化工模拟计算软件，熟练使用 AutoCAD 二维绘图软件；  4、有煤化工项目工艺专业负责人经历优先；具有高级及以上职称、注册化工工程师证书优先；  5、具备空分（深冷 / PSA 制氮）、固定床 / 气流床煤气化、生物质气化、CO 变换、干法脱硫、PSA 脱碳、胺法脱硫脱碳、甲醇洗、甲醇合成等煤化工核心装置工程设计经验； 6、有国网体系煤化工项目设计经历优先。","ClassificationOne":"金风绿能化工","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"10年及以上","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-15T11:11:07","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"fbacb597-b2ed-4991-9f36-132d95696b09","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310275975,"PostDateInt":1789372976000,"PostDate":"2026-09-14T16:02:56","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"齿轮箱专家(J24257)","OrgId":100200,"Org":"研发中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["北京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.齿轮箱整体设计与优化：负责风电主齿轮箱的方案设计，包括齿轮参数优化、结构布局、润滑与冷却系统设计，确保齿轮箱满足整机复杂工况及长期可靠运行要求。\n2.关键技术攻关与性能评估：对主齿轮箱关键零部件（齿轮、轴承、箱体、密封系统中1-2个）进行强度、寿命、可靠性及NVH特性分析与优化，主导齿轮修形、系统变形补偿等关键技术方案的制定。\n3.供应商技术审核：审核供应商的设计方案、计算报告、试验验证报告及质量控制计划，确保技术方案符合规范并具备工程可实现性。\n4.跨专业协同：与整机、控制、润滑、散热等多专业团队紧密协作，推动齿轮箱设计与整机系统深度融合。\n5.技术规划与标准建设：参与主齿轮箱技术路线规划、设计规范及技术标准制定，推动设计方法、仿真能力及测试手段的持续提升(R4岗及以上适用本条)","Require":"任职要求：\n学历要求：本科及以上，机械工程、电气工程、电气自动化、工程力学、风电工程等相关专业；\n工作年限：10年以上风电相关工作经验；有齿轮箱设计经验优先；\n核心能力要求：\n1.熟练掌握齿轮计算修形、齿面接触分析、系统变形分析等核心技术方法，深入掌握ISO、AGMA等齿轮强度标准；\n2.逻辑分析与工程解决问题能力：具备严谨的逻辑思维能力，能够系统性分析和解决复杂传动系统问题。\n3.具备失效分析与问题解决能力，有丰富的现场失效分析、复盘整改、项目攻坚实战经验，可输出决策级技术方案；\n4.沟通与协作能力：具备优秀的跨部门及跨公司沟通能力，能够高效协调内外部资源，推动项目技术合作与落地。